    {
      "source": "Wraps a value with the JDBCType that should be used to pass it as a bind parameter to a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/PreparedStatement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>PreparedStatement</code></a>. Register a converter from any type to <a href=\"JdbcValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.mapping\"><code>JdbcValue</code></a> in order to control the\nvalue and the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/JDBCType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>JDBCType</code></a> as which a value should get passed to the JDBC driver.",
      "translation": "将值包装为用于将其作为绑定参数传递给<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/PreparedStatement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>PreparedStatement</code></a>的 JDBCType。注册一个从任意类型到 <a href=\"JdbcValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.mapping\"><code>JdbcValue</code></a> 的转换器，以控制值以及应将其传递给 JDBC 驱动程序的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/JDBCType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>JDBCType</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
